        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "NVIDIA AI Cluster Runtime (AICR) now includes a qualified AI bill of materials (AIBOM) component built on the open source k8s-aibom project to track AI workloads running on Kubernetes.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/validating-gpu-platforms-with-runtime-ai-inventory-via-the-nvidia-dsx-ai-factory/",
