      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "AICR generates version-locked recipes and reproducible deployment bundles for GPU-accelerated Kubernetes, while k8s-aibom observes supported AI workloads and emits CycloneDX 1.6 AIBOM records with confidence tiers and evidence locators.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/validating-gpu-platforms-with-runtime-ai-inventory-via-the-nvidia-dsx-ai-factory/",
