      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "NVIDIA AI Cluster Runtime (AICR) , an open source modular component of the NVIDIA DSX AI Factory Platform , now includes a qualified AI bill of materials (AIBOM) component to close that gap.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://developer.nvidia.com/blog/validating-gpu-platforms-with-runtime-ai-inventory-via-the-nvidia-dsx-ai-factory/",
        "source": "NVIDIA Technical Blog",
