      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Start with a Google Kubernetes Engine (GKE) cluster running Kubernetes 1.32 or later, with NVIDIA H100 GPU nodes using Container-Optimized OS and GKE-managed drivers and device plugins.",
